  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.\r\rReason: This is required by Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).",
    "The development to which this permission relates shall be carried out in accordance with the materials specified on the approved plans and on the submitted application form unless otherwise agreed in writing by the local planning authority.\r\rReason: To ensure a satisfactory appearance on completion of the development, in accordance with Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CS8 and DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012.",
    "The works shall be carried out and maintained in accordance with the deposited Fire Statement /Reasonable Exception Statement compliant with Policy D12(A).\r\rReason: In the interests of fire safety and to ensure the safety of all building users in accordance with Policy D12 (Fire Safety) of the London Plan 2021.\r",
    "The accommodation hereby permitted shall be used only for purposes ancillary to the enjoyment of the existing dwelling house as a single family dwelling unit known as 16 Burton Close  and shall not be occupied as an independent or self-contained dwelling unit.\r\rReason: To prevent the undesirable establishment of a separate independent unit of living accommodation in the interests of the residential amenity of the area and to ensure compliance with Policy DM10 of the Core Strategy (2012).\""
